@host = https://localhost:7059

### 1. Create a workout (expect 201, a Location header, and id/createdUtc set by the server)
POST {{host}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-09",
  "type": "Running",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "caloriesBurned": 300,
  "intensity": "Moderate",
  "notes": "Morning run"
}

### 2. Same type on the same date (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-09",
  "type": "Running",
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "caloriesBurned": 200,
  "intensity": "Low"
}

### 3. Validation failure (expect 400, error key "durationMinutes")
POST {{host}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-10",
  "type": "Running",
  "durationMinutes": 0,
  "caloriesBurned": 200,
  "intensity": "Low"
}

### 4. Over-posting: id and createdUtc from the client must be ignored (expect 201, id is NOT 999)
POST {{host}}/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "createdUtc": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "date": "2026-10-11",
  "type": "Yoga",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "caloriesBurned": 150,
  "intensity": "Low"
}

### 5. List all (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/api/workouts

### 6. Filter by type (expect 200, only Running)
GET {{host}}/api/workouts?type=Running

### 7. Get one (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/api/workouts/1

### 8. Get one that does not exist (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/workouts/999

### 9. Replace workout 1 (expect 204)
PUT {{host}}/api/workouts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-09",
  "type": "Running",
  "durationMinutes": 35,
  "caloriesBurned": 350,
  "intensity": "High"
}

### 10. Replace one that does not exist (expect 404)
PUT {{host}}/api/workouts/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-09",
  "type": "Running",
  "durationMinutes": 35,
  "caloriesBurned": 350,
  "intensity": "High"
}

### 11. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/workouts/1

### 12. Delete again (expect 404)
DELETE {{host}}/api/workouts/1
